      "severity": "high",
      "finding": "A BPM anchor could admit typoglycemia, invisible-format, hex or double-percent encoded control overrides before semantic screening.",
      "resolution": "The deterministic pre-generation gate now rejects bounded action-plus-target typoglycemia, unsafe Unicode format/control shaping, hex payloads and two percent-decoding layers before aliases, semantic similarity, retrieval or inference.",
